@startuml C4-Dynamic-SSOLogin
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false

title Dynamic — SSO login (OIDC Authorization Code)

actor "End User" as user
participant "Business App\nRelying Party" as app <<ui>>
participant "IAM Application\nOIDC Provider :9100" as iam <<java>>
participant "External IdP\nGoogle / GitHub" as idp <<external>>
database "Metadata DB" as db <<db>>

user -> app: 1. Access protected resource
app --> user: 2. Start /oauth2/authorize\n(web redirect or ASWebAuthenticationSession)
user -> iam: 3. GET /oauth2/authorize\n(client_id, redirect_uri, scope, state, PKCE)
iam -> db: 4. Load RegisteredClient
db --> iam: 5. Client settings
alt No local session
  iam --> user: 6. Redirect /login?client_id=…
  user -> iam: 7. Form login or OAuth2 Login
  opt External IdP
    iam --> user: 8. Redirect to IdP
    user -> idp: 9. Authenticate
    idp --> iam: 10. OAuth2 callback
    iam -> db: 11. Upsert FederatedIdentityLink + IamUser
  end
end
iam --> user: 12. Consent (if required) + redirect with code
user -> app: 13. redirect_uri?code=…&state=…
alt Confidential client
  app -> iam: 14a. POST /oauth2/token\n(client_id, client_secret, code)
else Public native client (PKCE)
  app -> iam: 14b. POST /oauth2/token\n(client_id, code, code_verifier)\nno client_secret
end
iam --> app: 15. Access Token (+ ID / Refresh)\nemail/profile claims on access token when scoped
app -> iam: 16. JWKS verify / userinfo (optional)
app --> user: 17. Application session / Bearer API calls

note right of iam
  Demo: demo / demo-password
  Discovery: /.well-known/openid-configuration
  Native seeds: explore-ai-ios, explore-chat-ios
  Custom-scheme redirects allowed (RFC 8252)
end note

@enduml
